    if k == 208 { return "`excluded \"space: ...\"` is an **out-of-bounds declaration**: it removes a space from what this program may touch, and it is a promise written for a security audit. Using that space again therefore contradicts your own promise - and that is **deliberate**, not the compiler being fussy."; }
    if k == 209 { return "`excluded “space: ...”` 是**出界声明**：它把一个空间从“本程序可以碰的”里拿掉，是给安全审计看的一份承诺。于是再用那个空间就与自己的承诺冲突 —— 这是**故意的**，不是编译器挑剔。"; }
    if k == 210 { return "`excluded` declares that this unit will not use some space. A syscall on excluded space says both that it uses it and that it does not; both cannot hold, so it is refused at compile time."; }
    if k == 211 { return "`excluded` 是**这一单元不会用到某段空间**的声明。系统调用号落在被排除的空间上，等于在同一份源里同时说了「我用」和「我不用」—— 两条不可能同时成立，所以编译期就拒。"; }
    if k == 212 { return "Loment's aggregate types (`struct` / `enum`) are **move** by default: passing one by value to a function, or assigning one to another variable, hands over ownership. Types whose fields are **all integers** are `Copy` automatically and never report this."; }
    if k == 213 { return "Loment 的聚合类型（`struct` / `enum`）默认是**移动**语义：按值传进函数、按值赋给另一个变量，都相当于把所有权交出去。**全字段是整型**的类型自动按 `Copy` 处理，不会报这条。"; }
    if k == 214 { return "Loment's aggregate types (`struct` / `enum`) are **move** by default: passing one by value to a function, or assigning one to another variable, hands over ownership. Types whose fields are **all integers** are `Copy` automatically and never report this."; }
