    if k == 216 { return "`&mut` is an **exclusive** borrow (the same rule as Rust): while a mutable borrow is alive, no other borrow - not even a read-only one - may exist alongside it. This is not about performance; the answer to \"who may change it\" has to be unique."; }
    if k == 217 { return "`&mut` 是**独占**借用（与 Rust 同一套规则）：可变借用存在期间，别的借用（包括只读的）都不能同时存在。这不是性能问题，是“谁能改它”的答案必须唯一。"; }
