    if k == 302 { return "`as` performs a **bit-level** conversion only: integer<->integer, integer<->bool, pointer<->integer. Anything else (a string to a number, a struct to a struct) is not a conversion but a parse or a construction, and the steps have to be written out."; }
    if k == 303 { return "`as` 只做**位级**的转换：整数⇄整数、整数⇄布尔、指针⇄整数。别的（字符串→数字、结构体→结构体）不是“转换”而是“解析/构造”，必须写出过程来。"; }
