    if k == 315 { return "第 1 阶段只收**标量**（`i8..i64` / `u8..u64` / `bool`）与 `ptr`。`str` 在 Loment 里是“**指针 + 长度**”，**不是** C 字符串，两者不通用；结构体/枚举按值传要另一套寄存器分类规则 —— 都会**改变调用点的代码形状**，所以一律报错退出而不是静默错编。"; }
    if k == 316 { return "Two different things are managed here: (1) **the core mode** is a property of **the whole program**, and it has **five dimensions** - `mode` (`std` / `no_std`: which layer is available), `gc` (`gc_manual` / `gc_auto` / `gc_auto_alpha` / `no_gc`: who reclaims), `runtime` (`runtime` / `no_runtime`: whether the artifact carries one), `port` (`sealed` / `hosted`: whether it reaches outside itself), and `vm` (`vm` / `no_vm`: which execution model). **Each dimension may be declared once**, and only in the root unit (nothing outside `loment.conf` can change it); two dimensions contradicting each other (`gc_auto` with `no_runtime`) is reported here too. (2) **a switch** is \"code that is compiled in only when it is on\". There can be many switches, but **one name may be written once**, and a value may only be set after `set choose` declared it. A library may not `choose`: to express a need, a library declares a **capability requirement** and the project decides. (3) The `runtime` dimension is **not** managed here: a construct that would drag the runtime in (division, `alloc`, ...) is reported as **E030** (`docs/227`) - that code is about the construct, this one is about `choose` itself."; }
    if k == 317 { return "这是**两个不同的东西**被放在一起管：① **核心模式**是**整个程序**的属性，而且它有**五维** —— `mode`（`std` / `no_std`：能用哪一层）、`gc`（`gc_manual` / `gc_auto` / `gc_auto_alpha` / `no_gc`：回收由谁做）、`runtime`（`runtime` / `no_runtime`：产物里有没有运行期）、`port`（`sealed` / `hosted`：通不通着世界）、`vm`（`vm` / `no_vm`：要哪种执行模型）。**每一维各自只能声明一次**，而且只能在根单元（`loment.conf` 之外没有第二个地方能改它）；两维取值互相矛盾（`gc_auto` 与 `no_runtime`）也在这里报。② **开关**是“打开才编进去的代码”，可以有很多条，但**同名只许写一次**、**取值前必须先 `set choose` 定义**。库不许 `choose` —— 库要表达需要就声明**能力需求**，由项目决定开不开。③ `runtime` 那一维**不在这里**：用了会拖运行期的构造（`alloc`、`panic` …）报的是 **E030**（`docs/227`）—— 那一码说的是那个构造，这一码说的是 `choose` 自己。"; }
    if k == 318 { return "Two different things are managed here: (1) **the core mode** is a property of **the whole program**, and it has **five dimensions** - `mode` (`std` / `no_std`: which layer is available), `gc` (`gc_manual` / `gc_auto` / `gc_auto_alpha` / `no_gc`: who reclaims), `runtime` (`runtime` / `no_runtime`: whether the artifact carries one), `port` (`sealed` / `hosted`: whether it reaches outside itself), and `vm` (`vm` / `no_vm`: which execution model). **Each dimension may be declared once**, and only in the root unit (nothing outside `loment.conf` can change it); two dimensions contradicting each other (`gc_auto` with `no_runtime`) is reported here too. (2) **a switch** is \"code that is compiled in only when it is on\". There can be many switches, but **one name may be written once**, and a value may only be set after `set choose` declared it. A library may not `choose`: to express a need, a library declares a **capability requirement** and the project decides. (3) The `runtime` dimension is **not** managed here: a construct that would drag the runtime in (division, `alloc`, ...) is reported as **E030** (`docs/227`) - that code is about the construct, this one is about `choose` itself."; }
