    if k == 374 { return "Loading is the compiler's first pass, and this happens before it. \"The file cannot be read\" and \"the source in it is wrong\" are two different things: no edit to the source can fix the first, so it gets its own code and is **not** a syntax error (E019). An empty file lands here too - that is not \"written wrongly\", it is \"nothing to read\"."; }
    if k == 375 { return "装载是编译的第一趟，而这一条发生在它之前。「文件读不到」与「文件里的源码写错了」是两件不同的事：前者无论如何改源码都解决不了，所以它单独一个码、而且**不是**语法错（E019）。空文件也落在这里 —— 那不是「写错了」，是「没得读」。"; }
