    if k == 384 { return "A borrow is a **static** promise: `&T` is valid only while the source is alive. Loment infers the source from regions - a returned borrow may only come from a **parameter** (a local dies with the call), and an explicit `&a T` marker may only name a reference parameter in the signature. `free(p)` also ends p's region, so no borrow may still point at it."; }
