    if k == 415 { return "借用是一条**静态**承诺：`&T` 只在来源还活着时有效。Loment 从区域推出来源 —— 返回值只能借自**形参**（局部变量出了函数就不存在），显式标记 `&a T` 只能指向签名里的一个引用形参。`free(p)` 也会结束 `p` 的区域，所以释放时不能再有指向它的借用。"; }
    if k == 416 { return "Loading is the compiler's first pass, and this happens before it. \"The file cannot be read\" and \"the source in it is wrong\" are two different things: no edit to the source can fix the first, so it gets its own code and is **not** a syntax error (E019). An empty file lands here too - that is not \"written wrongly\", it is \"nothing to read\"."; }
    if k == 417 { return "装载是编译的第一趟，而这一条发生在它之前。「文件读不到」与「文件里的源码写错了」是两件不同的事：前者无论如何改源码都解决不了，所以它单独一个码、而且**不是**语法错（E019）。空文件也落在这里 —— 那不是「写错了」，是「没得读」。"; }
    if k == 418 { return "Loment has **no implicit numeric conversion** and no type inference: every position must match explicitly. A `u32` value never becomes an `i64` on its own, and the integer `1` is not the `bool` `true`."; }
    if k == 419 { return "Loment **没有隐式数值转换**，也没有类型推断：每个位置上的类型必须显式对得上。所以 `u32` 的值不会自动变成 `i64`，整数 `1` 也不是 `bool` 的 `true`。"; }
    if k == 420 { return "Two different things are managed here: (1) **the core mode** is a property of **the whole program**, and it has **five dimensions** - `mode` (`std` / `no_std`: which layer is available), `gc` (`gc_manual` / `gc_auto` / `gc_auto_alpha` / `no_gc`: who reclaims), `runtime` (`runtime` / `no_runtime`: whether the artifact carries one), `port` (`sealed` / `hosted`: whether it reaches outside itself), and `vm` (`vm` / `no_vm`: which execution model). **Each dimension may be declared once**, and only in the root unit (nothing outside `loment.conf` can change it); two dimensions contradicting each other (`gc_auto` with `no_runtime`) is reported here too. (2) **a switch** is \"code that is compiled in only when it is on\". There can be many switches, but **one name may be written once**, and a value may only be set after `set choose` declared it. A library may not `choose`: to express a need, a library declares a **capability requirement** and the project decides. (3) The `runtime` dimension is **not** managed here: a construct that would drag the runtime in (division, `alloc`, ...) is reported as **E030** (`docs/227`) - that code is about the construct, this one is about `choose` itself."; }
    if k == 421 { return "这是**两个不同的东西**被放在一起管：① **核心模式**是**整个程序**的属性，而且它有**五维** —— `mode`（`std` / `no_std`：能用哪一层）、`gc`（`gc_manual` / `gc_auto` / `gc_auto_alpha` / `no_gc`：回收由谁做）、`runtime`（`runtime` / `no_runtime`：产物里有没有运行期）、`port`（`sealed` / `hosted`：通不通着世界）、`vm`（`vm` / `no_vm`：要哪种执行模型）。**每一维各自只能声明一次**，而且只能在根单元（`loment.conf` 之外没有第二个地方能改它）；两维取值互相矛盾（`gc_auto` 与 `no_runtime`）也在这里报。② **开关**是“打开才编进去的代码”，可以有很多条，但**同名只许写一次**、**取值前必须先 `set choose` 定义**。库不许 `choose` —— 库要表达需要就声明**能力需求**，由项目决定开不开。③ `runtime` 那一维**不在这里**：用了会拖运行期的构造（`alloc`、`panic` …）报的是 **E030**（`docs/227`）—— 那一码说的是那个构造，这一码说的是 `choose` 自己。"; }
    if k == 422 { return "Loment has **no implicit numeric conversion** and no type inference: every position must match explicitly. A `u32` value never becomes an `i64` on its own, and the integer `1` is not the `bool` `true`."; }
